{"name": "Inferno", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/be54eb23fc383c1a81f9ecc46848597f.webp?t=1788494305\" width=\"568\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Out of the ashes comes Inferno: </strong>a 2D platform action-adventure game heavily inspired by 16-bit platformers.  In this militaristic setting, play as Kai; a sergeant in the Krorion Space Forces, searching for his ex-commanding officer, Ion, after a routine mission goes awry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/8200cf3dfb8f3f09d2afea66cfdc6012.webp?t=1788494305\" width=\"568\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tight and responsive controls </strong>deliberately designed to function on a 3-button Genesis controller, while keeping the same fluidity on modern gamepads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"318\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/812bac65fcd657d99c4f99e7999e603e.poster.avif?t=1788494305\" width=\"568\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/812bac65fcd657d99c4f99e7999e603e.webm?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/812bac65fcd657d99c4f99e7999e603e.mp4?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging gameplay and boss battles </strong>with escalating encounters  that demand both quick reflexes and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/44632394f65715ce65d8b0920d69ce7a.poster.avif?t=1788494305\" width=\"568\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/44632394f65715ce65d8b0920d69ce7a.webm?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/44632394f65715ce65d8b0920d69ce7a.mp4?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/34639e9c23a5e6deedb0ee602319a83e.poster.avif?t=1788494305\" width=\"568\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/34639e9c23a5e6deedb0ee602319a83e.webm?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430170/extras/34639e9c23a5e6deedb0ee602319a83e.mp4?t=1788494305\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore different, dangerous areas </strong>and interact with environments directly through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"318\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_a